  "description": "Locale.CLI is a powerful cross-platform command-line tool for managing localization files. Features include: scan (detect missing/orphan keys), diff (compare files), check (validate rules), convert (transform formats), generate (create skeleton files), watch (monitor changes), and translate (auto-translate using Google, DeepL, Bing, Yandex, LibreTranslate, OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, Azure OpenAI, Ollama, or Nvidia).",
